					"nextDialogs": [
						721130610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130610,
					"content": "到這裡就斷開了，不知道下半是什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130611,
					"content": "不過既然會用到暗號，背後一定隱藏著什麼秘密吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721130612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721130612,
					"content": "好在意啊。下次去鳴神大社解籤的時候，要不要試著對對暗號？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
